<%- include('../partials/head',{title:'New Enrollment'}) %><%- include('../partials/nav') %>
<div class="container"><div class="page-header"><div><span class="eyebrow-label">New application</span><h4>Let’s start your enrollment</h4><p>Tell us which school year and learning path you are applying for.</p></div><a class="btn btn-light border" href="/dashboard"><i class="bi bi-x-lg me-1"></i>Save and exit</a></div>
<%- include('_steps',{current:1}) %>
<div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="card"><div class="card-section-header"><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i>Application details</div><div class="card-body p-lg-4"><form method="post" action="/enroll/basic"><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">School year</label><input class="form-control" name="school_year" placeholder="e.g. 2026-2027" pattern="\d{4}-\d{4}" required><div class="form-text">Use the format YYYY-YYYY.</div></div><div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Grade level</label><select class="form-select" name="grade_level"><option value="11">Grade 11</option><option value="12">Grade 12</option></select></div><div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Semester</label><select class="form-select" name="semester"><option>First Semester</option><option>Second Semester</option></select></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Preferred track</label><select class="form-select" name="preferred_track"><option>Academic</option><option>Technical-Professional</option></select><div class="form-text">You can still choose any available strand after your results.</div></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Goal after Senior High School</label><select class="form-select" name="curriculum_exit"><option>Higher Education</option><option>Employment</option><option>Entrepreneurship</option><option>Middle-Level Skills Development</option></select></div></div><div class="form-actions"><span class="small text-muted"><i class="bi bi-shield-check me-1"></i>Your answers are saved securely.</span><button class="btn btn-primary">Continue <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i></button></div></form></div></div></div>
<div class="col-lg-4"><div class="guidance-card"><div class="guidance-icon"><i class="bi bi-signpost-split"></i></div><h5>What happens next?</h5><ol><li>Complete the RIASEC interest test.</li><li>Review your strand compatibility.</li><li>Choose a strand and rank electives.</li></ol><p>You stay in control of the final strand choice.</p></div></div></div></div><%- include('../partials/foot') %>
